flowchart LR
  B[Browser / React workspace] --> T[tRPC over Express]
  T --> P[protectedProcedure\nAuthenticated session actor]
  P --> A[Clinic scope + role authorization\nserver/authz/clinicScope.ts]
  A --> D[Domain modules\nworkspace · tasks · care plan · audit]
  D --> R[(SQLite\ndata/nightingale.sqlite)]

  S[Source interaction\nclinician / staff / patient] --> X[PHI redaction\nserver/modules/aiScribe/redact.ts]
  X --> M[Deterministic mock Scribe\nno external LLM]
  M --> AI[careEntries\nSystem · draft · aiType]
  AI -->|sourceEntryId + provenancePointer| R
  AI --> V[AI highlights / Glance projection]
  V -->|resolve source + focus| B

  CE[careEntries\nTimeline spine] --> CM[typed collaboration / escalation entries\ncomment-like records]
  CE --> H[Glance highlights / risk candidates]
  CP[carePlanSections\ncurrent plan] --> CV[carePlanSectionVersions\nappend-only history / reverts]
  CP --> R
  CV --> R
  G[auditLogs\nmetadata-only governance projection] --> R
  D --> G

